25
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,000
Those who know would say

26
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,460
Zhuo Yu'an runs a company.

27
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,520
Those who don't would think

28
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,920
