I apologize.

36
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:36,640
Fine.

37
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,160
If we don't talk about work,

38
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,240
there's even less of a relationship
between us in private

39
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,840
