In addition,

63
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,080
this bid report

64
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,060
[The Bid Report by Hongzheng Law Firm
for Zhuoyuan Technology]

65
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,000
